WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.515
IF YOU KNOW WHERE TO GO.

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:10.089
[TALKING AND LAUGHTER]

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.135
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:23.972 --> 00:00:27.237
AH, HAGRID!
THE USUAL, I PRESUME?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.368
NO, THANKS, TOM.

00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:31.371
I'M ON OFFICIAL
HOGWARTS BUSINESS.

00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:32.894
JUST HELPING
YOUNG HARRY HERE

00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:33.895
BUY HIS SCHOOL SUPPLIES.

00:00:33.939 --> 00:00:36.028
BLESS MY SOUL.

00:00:36.071 --> 00:00:38.509
IT'S HARRY POTTER.

00:00:38.552 --> 00:00:39.988
[MUSIC STOPS]

00:00:40.032 --> 00:00:42.339
[TALKING STOPS]

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:44.210
WELCOME BACK,
MR. POTTER.

00:00:44.254 --> 00:00:46.169
WELCOME BACK.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.083
DORIS CROCKFORD,
MR. POTTER.

00:00:48.127 --> 00:00:50.782
I CAN'T BELIEVE I'M
MEETING YOU AT LAST.

00:00:50.825 --> 00:00:53.741
[STUTTERING]
HARRY P-POTTER.

00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:54.960
C-CAN'T TELL YOU

00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:56.483
HOW PLEASED I AM
TO MEET YOU.

00:00:56.527 --> 00:00:59.094
HELLO, PROFESSOR.
I DIDN'T SEE YOU THERE.

00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:01.096
HARRY, THIS IS
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.447
HE'LL BE YOUR DEFENSE
AGAINST THE DARK ARTS TEACHER

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.448
AT HOGWARTS.

00:01:04.491 --> 00:01:06.189
OH. NICE TO MEET YOU.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:10.062
F-FEARFULLY
FASCINATING SUBJECT.

00:01:10.105 --> 00:01:15.415
N-NOT THAT YOU NEED IT,
EH, POTTER?

00:01:15.459 --> 00:01:18.375
YES, WELL,
MUST BE GOING NOW.

00:01:18.418 --> 00:01:20.246
LOTS TO BUY.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.639
GOOD-BYE.

00:01:24.859 --> 00:01:26.383
SEE, HARRY,
YOU'RE FAMOUS.

00:01:26.426 --> 00:01:28.211
BUT WHY AM I FAMOUS,
HAGRID?

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.300
ALL THOSE PEOPLE
BACK THERE,

00:01:30.343 --> 00:01:32.258
HOW IS IT
THEY KNOW WHO I AM?

00:01:32.302 --> 00:01:34.129
I'M NOT SURE I'M EXACTLY
THE RIGHT PERSON

00:01:34.173 --> 00:01:36.262
TO TELL YOU THAT, HARRY.

00:01:36.306 --> 00:01:37.829
[TAPPING]

00:01:39.178 --> 00:01:41.180
[SCRAPING]

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.154
WELCOME, HARRY,
TO DIAGON ALLEY.
